  "number": 5593,
  "title": "Support `<script type=\"module\">` imports for Fluent skin pack",
  "body": "<!-- Please provide the issue number here if any -->\r\n\r\n> Related to #5592.\r\n\r\n## Changelog Entry\r\n\r\n<!-- Please paste your new entry from CHANGELOG.MD here. Entry is not required for work only related to development purposes. -->\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- (Experimental) Added support for importing via `<script type=\"module\">`, by [@compulim](https://github.com/compulim) in PR [#5592](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/5592)\r\n   - Added support for `botframework-webchat-fluent-theme` package, by [@compulim](https://github.com/compulim) in PR [#5593](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/5593)\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\n<!-- Please discuss the changes you have worked on. What do the changes do; why is this PR needed? -->\r\n\r\nAdding exports for `<script type=\"module\">` in `botframework-webchat-fluent-theme` package.\r\n\r\nAs a side-effect, we are also exporting a repack of React 18 because Fluent UI requires JSX Runtime (`react(-dom)@>=17`). The repack helps web developers on sovereign cloud and airgapped-environment to host Web Chat without third party CDN services.\r\n\r\n## Design\r\n\r\n<!-- If this feature is complicated in nature, please provide additional clarifications. -->\r\n\r\n- Fluent UI 9 requires JSX Runtime\r\n   - We need to repack `react(-dom)@18` in additional to the current `react(-dom)@16.8.6` for sovereign cloud and airgapped environment\r\n- When using our precompiled CDN bits, importing from [esm.sh](https://esm.sh/) will need to reroute `react(-dom)` to our CDN bits to maintain singularity of React\r\n- CDN bits is in a 2-level directory hierarchy for `react(-dom)` for now, we will do it for other packages in another PR\r\n   - `static/react-dom.js`\r\n   - `static/react-dom/client.js`\r\n   - `static/react-dom/chunk-*.js`\r\n   - This helps web server operators to configure their web server to reduce the complexity requirement of import maps\r\n\r\n## Specific Changes\r\n\r\n<!-- Please list the changes in a concise manner. -->\r\n\r\n- Added new exports at `botframework-webchat-fluent-theme/static`\r\n- Added new `repack/react(-dom)@18` ESM-repacked packages\r\n- Added tests for our CDN bits, vendor bits from [esm.sh](https://esm.sh/), and from [esm.sh/tsx](https://esm.sh/#tsx)\r\n\r\n<!-- For bugs, add the bug repro as a test. Otherwise, add tests to futureproof your work. -->\r\n\r\n-  [x] I have added tests and executed them locally\r\n-  [x] I have updated `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n-  [x] ~I have updated documentation~\r\n\r\n## Review Checklist\r\n\r\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\r\n\r\n-  [x] ~Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)~\r\n-  [x] ~Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed~\r\n-  [x] ~CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)~\r\n-  [x] ~Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)~\r\n-  [x] ~Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)~\r\n-  [x] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\r\n-  [x] ~Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)~\r\n-  [x] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\r\n",
